      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "I wanted to Feature request a similar thing, for a long tome now i been wondering why this hasnt been implemented yet:\n\nMy Take on the feature is minimal:\n\nIf a user in vr pust down their headset (steamVR AFK), then let us Passtrough Mic toggle button (V) and an option to Spawn / Use the chatbox. so that while user might be out of headset for few minutes, making food or smthn, they already still are able to hear all audio and voices. but have no way to quickly open chatbox or change mic to whatever they have on desktop..\n\nis this worth making a new request? i feel like all the other feature requests in this matter imply asking for full camera control -> switch to Desktop VRChat but what we really only need is jus a means to communicate when the headset is temporarily on the desk",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    },
